{
 "_notes": {
  "how": "Edit any value and reload the page. Colours accept #hex, rgb()/rgba(), transparent or a reference like \"@ink\" (another variable). Sizes accept px, rem, em, vh, vw, % or ch.",
  "breakpoints": "Minimum viewport width in px where each step starts. Below 'desktop' the band wraps its page links onto a second row.",
  "components": "Values directly inside a component apply from 0 px up; an object named after a breakpoint (\"desktop\", \"large\"…) overrides them from that width up.",
  "chart.big": "Bars read by name (Skills as bars, Technical domains): big-font-size is the names and figures, big-row-height each bar's row, big-label-max the widest a name gets before it wraps.",
  "panels": "Each panel is a block inside a section, on a 12-column grid: span (1-12), order, height of its chart, hidden.",
  "site.field": "The landing's animated background: seats (small cubes bouncing off each other), shapes (Swiss forms floating), bubbles (blobs that merge and part) or cubes (cubes that grow and shed smaller ones). Try one with ?field=… on the landing."
 },
